## Development notes

This project was developed with AI assistance ([Claude](https://claude.ai) by Anthropic). All code has been reviewed, tested, debugged, and is maintained by the author. The architecture decisions, feature design, bug investigations, and overall direction are human-driven — Claude was used as a development tool, in the same way one might use an IDE, a Stack Overflow answer, or a pairing partner.

If you're contributing: the codebase is consistent and intentional throughout. If something looks unusual or you have questions about a design decision, open an issue — there's a person behind it who can explain the reasoning.